== browse

A text browser for TORTOISE. It shows HTML and plain text, follows http: and
file: links and never runs scripts.

* Up and down arrows, k and j: the previous and next link
* Space, + and Page Down: the next page; - and Page Up: the previous one
* Enter, Right arrow and l: follow the link; a number and Enter: follow that
   link
* Left arrow, Backspace and u: go back
* g: go to an address; r: reload; =: show the address of the page and the link
* /: find text; n: find it again
* ? and h: this help; q: quit










up/down: link  enter: follow  left: back  space: page  g: go  ?: help  q: quit[0m[2J[H$ 
$ kill %1; wait
$ shutdown 0
